*.log

# --- Database ---
*.sqlite3
pgdata/

# --- Power BI (binary/generated, regenerable via `ingest-data export-powerbi`) ---
dashboards/powerbi/*.pbix.bak
dashboards/powerbi/data/*
!dashboards/powerbi/data/.gitkeep

# --- Streamlit public dataset ---
# Unlike the internal Power BI export (dashboards/powerbi/data/), these 15 CSVs ARE
# committed: they're privacy-reviewed, aggregate-only (no customer_id/customer_key —
# see dashboards/streamlit/data/public/README.md), and Streamlit Community Cloud has
# no PostgreSQL access, so the deployed app can only serve what's in the repo.
# Regenerate with `ingest-data export-public` before committing an update.
dashboards/streamlit/data/public/_export_generated_at.txt

